{"id": "sfo-terminal-three-retail-holdover-and-rent", "title": "A Terminal 3 shop stayed past its bid term. The lease tells when rent could restart.", "seconds": 40.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6223ba66de9354e4", "words": 104, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The airport put a sunglass shop out to bid.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.46, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Seven", "years", "plus", "two"], "sub": "A holdover after the nine-year limit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.64, 0.82, 0.89, 1.43, 1.7, 1.87, 1.97]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Its nine years ended in March 2019.", "t0": 2.58, "t1": 5.07, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "A holdover after the nine-year limit", "text": "March 5, 2019", "mark": "March"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.48, 0.77, 1.05, 1.17, 1.5, 1.82]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Airport staff attributed the holdover to administrative delays.", "t0": 5.19, "t1": 8.66, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Administrative delays"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.83, 1.34, 1.46, 1.99, 2.13, 2.85]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Construction delays later kept four concessions in place.", "t0": 8.88, "t1": 12.26, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4 concessions", "label": "Construction delayed, four concessions continued"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 1.08, 1.41, 1.74, 2.1, 2.7, 2.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Supervisors approved a second extension through December 2023.", "t0": 12.38, "t1": 16.65, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bundle", "kicker": "Construction delayed, four concessions continued", "text": "Second extension", "mark": "Second"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.79, 1.26, 1.38, 1.74, 2.32, 2.57, 3.12, 3.48]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Then the pandemic changed how minimum rent worked.", "t0": 16.77, "t1": 19.68, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Minimum rent suspended"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.33, 0.89, 1.42, 1.67, 2.13, 2.43]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "This lease used departures from Boarding Area F.", "t0": 19.8, "t1": 22.89, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "lease", "kicker": "Boarding Area F crossed the rent threshold", "text": "Boarding Area F", "mark": "Boarding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.86, 1.15, 1.77, 1.98, 2.34, 2.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The comparison year was 2008.", "t0": 23.01, "t1": 25.13, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2008", "label": "Boarding Area F crossed the rent threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.77, 1.0, 1.19, 1.39, 1.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two months above the threshold pointed to January 2022.", "t0": 25.25, "t1": 29.18, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "lease", "kicker": "Boarding Area F crossed the rent threshold", "text": "January 2022", "mark": "January"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 1.01, 1.13, 1.71, 2.11, 2.23, 2.8, 3.16]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By June, four in ten airport leases had resumed minimum rent.", "t0": 29.4, "t1": 33.38, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "About 40%", "label": "The audited accounts leave individual bills open"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.74, 1.04, 1.16, 1.49, 1.96, 2.37, 2.54, 3.16, 3.63]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The public accounts do not identify this shop’s payments.", "t0": 33.5, "t1": 37.07, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Individual invoices still needed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.61, 1.13, 1.36, 1.68, 2.29, 2.5, 2.93]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.19, "t1": 39.83, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A holdover after the nine-year limit", "b": "Construction delayed, four concessions continued", "o": "The audited accounts leave individual bills open"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}